<th id="S4.T1.5.2.7" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_t" style="padding:1pt 14.0pt;">48.93/48.68</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="S4.T1.5.3" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S4.T1.5.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_t" style="padding:1pt 14.0pt;">FGSM-RS <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib16" title="" class="ltx_ref">16</a>]</cite></th>
